{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"title":"dropReports","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Consent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L117"},"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA0B10DropReportOGvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read. A record dropped for room is reported as it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped; while that report waits unread, later ones merge into it, one report counting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them all across their timestamps. So the reports waiting unread hold at most one overflow","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report between any two others (denials and finished trackers), however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overflow. The sequence ends once the consent is gone and every report has been read.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/dropReports":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIde